{"id":"nave:elkanah","source":"nave","name":"Elkanah","slug":"elkanah","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Grandson of Korah Ex 6:24; 1Ch 6:23","refs":[["Exod",6,24,6,24],["1Chr",6,23,6,23]]},{"text":"2. Father of Samuel; a descendant of the preceding 1Sa 1:1,4,8,19,21,23; 2:11,20; 1Ch 6:27,34","refs":[["1Sam",1,1,1,1],["1Sam",1,4,1,4],["1Sam",1,8,1,8],["1Sam",1,19,1,19],["1Sam",1,21,1,21],["1Sam",1,23,1,23],["1Sam",2,11,2,11],["1Sam",2,20,2,20],["1Chr",6,27,6,27],["1Chr",6,34,6,34]]},{"text":"3. A Levite 1Ch 6:25,36","refs":[["1Chr",6,25,6,25],["1Chr",6,36,6,36]]},{"text":"4. Possibly identical with number three above 1Ch 6:26,35","refs":[["1Chr",6,26,6,26],["1Chr",6,35,6,35]]},{"text":"5. A Levite 1Ch 9:16","refs":[["1Chr",9,16,9,16]]},{"text":"6. A Levite who joined David at Ziklag 1Ch 12:6","refs":[["1Chr",12,6,12,6]]},{"text":"7. A doorkeeper for the ark, perhaps identical with number six above 1Ch 15:23","refs":[["1Chr",15,23,15,23]]},{"text":"8. A prince of Ahaz 2Ch 28:7","refs":[["2Chr",28,7,28,7]]}],"refCount":20}
